        "questionHtml": "<section class=\"listening-source-group\" data-question-start=\"11\" data-question-end=\"16\" data-question-type=\"sentence-completion\"><header class=\"listening-source-header\"><p class=\"listening-source-range\">Questions 11-16</p><p class=\"listening-source-instruction\">Complete the notes below. Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS OR A NUMBER.</p></header><div class=\"listening-source-question-list\" role=\"list\"><p class=\"listening-source-title\"><strong>THE NATIONAL ARTS CENTER</strong></p><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"11\" role=\"listitem\">Well known for:  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 11\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"11\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(11)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Complex consists of: concert rooms, theatres, cinemas, art galleries, public library,</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"12\" role=\"listitem\">restaurants and a  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 12\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"12\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(12)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div><div class=\"listening-source-support-row\">Historical background: 1940-area destroyed by bombs</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"13\" role=\"listitem\">1960s-1970s: centre was  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 13\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"13\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(13)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> and built in  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 14\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"14\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(14)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> – opened to public</div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"15\" role=\"listitem\">Managed by: the  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 15\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"15\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(15)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></div><div class=\"listening-source-question-row\" data-question-row=\"16\" role=\"listitem\">Open:  <span aria-label=\"Blank for question 16\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"16\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(16)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> days per year</div></div></section><section class=\"listening-source-group\" data-question-start=\"17\" data-question-end=\"20\" data-question-type=\"sentence-completion\"><header class=\"listening-source-header\"><p class=\"listening-source-range\">Questions 17-20</p><p class=\"listening-source-instruction\">Complete the table below. Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS OR A NUMBER.</p></header><figure class=\"listening-source-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Time</th><th>Event</th><th>Venue</th><th>Ticket price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monday and Tuesday</td><td>7.30 pm</td><td>The Magic Flute</td><td><span aria-label=\"Blank for question 17\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"17\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(17)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span></td><td>From £ 8</td></tr><tr><td>Wednesday</td><td>8.00 pm</td><td><span aria-label=\"Blank for question 18\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"18\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(18)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span>(Canadian Flim)</td><td>Cinema 2</td><td><span aria-label=\"Blank for question 19\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"19\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(19)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span> £ </td></tr><tr><td>Saturday and Sunday</td><td>11 am to 10 pm</td><td><span aria-label=\"Blank for question 20\" class=\"listening-answer-blank\" data-question=\"20\" role=\"img\"><span class=\"listening-answer-number\">(20)</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"listening-answer-line\"> </span></span>(art exhibition)</td><td>Gallery 1</td><td>Free</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></section>",
